WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.825
Step six opens the day-thirty manifest.

2
00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:07.793
It names the step, parallel, its
mode, read-only, its controls,

3
00:00:07.793 --> 00:00:12.812
A C two and C A seven, its K S I,
and the hash of each file it wrote.

4
00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:14.874
Step seven re-hashes the plan.

5
00:00:14.874 --> 00:00:19.088
Every file's recorded hash matches
the file on disk, and that matters:

6
00:00:19.088 --> 00:00:22.775
the hash a reviewer approves is
the hash of the files on disk.

7
00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:26.675
Step eight runs this chapter's
tests: eleven pass, none fail.

8
00:00:26.675 --> 00:00:28.562
And step nine lists your runs.

9
00:00:28.562 --> 00:00:30.100
There's nothing to clean up.

10
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.162
The kit's folder is as you unzipped it,

11
00:00:32.162 --> 00:00:34.660
and this run's results
stay in its own folder.
